    "body": "## Summary\n\n- add the frozen `ParagraphEntitySpinPathR4V1` paragraph-scope selector over exact stored lexical `SpinTorsionState` paths;\n- bind the exact construction/table/#953 overlay, stored-spin provenance, spin-to-H4 rule, routing policy, fixed work schedule, controls, bounds, and canonical artifact replay;\n- keep query-time H4 fold/inverse/trace/scoring to prevalidated state, nested product-row, inverse-row, and root-coordinate table reads;\n- record the result and reconcile the current project claim surfaces and #973 sequencing.\n\n## Frozen result\n\n`RETAIN_PARAGRAPH_ENTITY_SPIN_PATH_ATTENTION_CONTINUE_CONVERSATION`\n\n| Arm | Exact |\n| --- | ---: |\n| real | 2/2 |\n| paragraph disabled | 1/2 |\n| entity binding permuted | 0/2 |\n| parsed fact vector reversed | 2/2 |\n\nSupport mismatches: 0. Declared-work mismatches: 0. Neither admitted candidate occurred in either held-out prompt, the prior-prefix copy operator abstained, and #953 support/count/radii/work remained unchanged.\n\n- operator: `blake3:9221efa7ad952e4890aae335970418b38ec93beb8cb4de65c5aa1d8c67f70afd`\n- target-free census: `blake3:515720686b96dbebc2f055f9a21d3f0684f76092018381c836b51abf47a4d197`\n- decoded smoke: `blake3:0ba32e5fe26f1280ec2eef2b115023de52f2ef946882352311dcecc531d76a32`\n\nEvery H4 angular shell tied at `Coincident`; fiber was the first sufficient discriminator. Torsion was measured and audited but was not independently qualified. This is one synthetic construction-bound exact-descriptor/entity-binding phase-path selector with a non-candidate-copy decoded consequence—not semantic/paraphrastic or natural transfer, anti-recall beyond exact candidate absence, intrinsic or prime/index-independent geometry, a general entity model, or general paragraph/conversation/global attention.\n\n#973 remains open for one independently frozen conversation-scope contrast, then bounded-global/corpus qualification. #954 remains blocked.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test -p uor-r4-core --offline --test paragraph_entity_spin_path_attention_973 -- --nocapture` — PASS (2 tests; outcome run 178.33s)\n- `cargo check -p uor-r4-core --tests --offline` — PASS\n- `cargo check --target wasm32-unknown-unknown -p uor-r4-wasm-router --lib --offline` — PASS\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` — PASS\n- `python3 scripts/check_claim_wording.py` — PASS\n- `git diff --check` — PASS\n\nWorkspace-wide/BDD/teacher/model/no-std/Gate C/kappa/audit/fuzz/corpus/product/performance/formal/release suites remain `NOT_RUN` under the frozen focused contract.\n\nReferences #973\n",
